## Summary

Expose machine-readable output from `uoc show` and `uoc raw` via `--json`.

## Motivation

- Enable scripting, automation, and downstream tools without scraping text.

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] `uoc show CODE --json` prints canonical JSON for the unit/course
- [ ] `uoc raw CODE --json` prints the raw underlying structure
- [ ] Document usage in `--help` with examples

